  "Starting cards as marked in the list: ISB Operations / Empire's Sinister Agents (Objective), Coruscant: Imperial Square '(SL)', Prepared Defenses '(SI)', Mobilization Points '(SE 1)' and Imperial Arrest Order '(SE 2)'; they count toward the 60. The third starting Effect varies: 'Start Decree against EBO decks, Secret Plans against WYS and the combo aginst everything else', so no single starting effect is shown; that comment line was mis-parsed as a card by the draft and removed, as was the deck-file header 'ISB tough 1.5.deck - Tue Apr 24 160501 2001'.",
  "The deck totals 60 cards as published.",
  "The strategy says this deck helped him get 6th at the Ohio State Championship (2001 Ohio State Championship); its only two losses were to Jamie Abel, playing two Tatooine decks using Monks and Underworld Contacts.",
